    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726130/extras/6611828246e2dc4e4fb5cdd23bc81b75.poster.avif?t=1742921670\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726130/extras/6611828246e2dc4e4fb5cdd23bc81b75.webm?t=1742921670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726130/extras/6611828246e2dc4e4fb5cdd23bc81b75.mp4?t=1742921670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear up for Non-Stop Action</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the action-packed world of The Tribes, the low-poly First-Person Shooter by Block Bastards. Battle it out in beautifully designed arenas, armed with Interoperable weapons. Are you ready to dominate the competition?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726130/extras/cd4b81419937ce4df8a5aef31d034035.avif?t=1742921670\" width=610 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Use your own Interoperable Weapons</strong> \u2014 Elevate your gaming experience with The Tribes. Unlock powerful weapons and bring them for a competitive edge like never before. With seamless interoperability, you can dominate in The Tribes and beyond. So why settle for a standard arsenal? Bring your own weapons and emerge victorious.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Explore all the different Tribes</strong> \u2014 Embrace the diverse cultures of the Rapper Tribe, the soulful Blues Tribe, the electrifying Metal Tribe, the laid-back Country Tribe and much more. Each tribe brings its own unique flair to the battlefield, offering distinct playstyles and aesthetics that will resonate with every gamer's preferences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Challenge your friends in different Game Modes</strong> \u2014 Experience the thrill of strategic teamwork and precision aiming in Capture the Flag. Dominate the battlefield alongside your squad in Team Deathmatch and test your individual mettle in Free-For-All battles! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Defend your Tribe in all the different maps</strong> \u2014 Battle across a variety of maps, from the bustling parking lot to the lively festival map and the gritty docks in Shipyard, testing your mettle. Adapt, outsmart, and defend your tribe to victory! </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726130/extras/6611828246e2dc4e4fb5cdd23bc81b75.poster.avif?t=1742921670\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726130/extras/6611828246e2dc4e4fb5cdd23bc81b75.webm?t=1742921670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726130/extras/6611828246e2dc4e4fb5cdd23bc81b75.mp4?t=1742921670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear up for Non-Stop Action</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the action-packed world of The Tribes, the low-poly First-Person Shooter by Block Bastards. Battle it out in beautifully designed arenas, armed with Interoperable weapons. Are you ready to dominate the competition?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2726130/extras/cd4b81419937ce4df8a5aef31d034035.avif?t=1742921670\" width=610 height=196 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Use your own Interoperable Weapons</strong> \u2014 Elevate your gaming experience with The Tribes. Unlock powerful weapons and bring them for a competitive edge like never before. With seamless interoperability, you can dominate in The Tribes and beyond. So why settle for a standard arsenal? Bring your own weapons and emerge victorious.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Explore all the different Tribes</strong> \u2014 Embrace the diverse cultures of the Rapper Tribe, the soulful Blues Tribe, the electrifying Metal Tribe, the laid-back Country Tribe and much more. Each tribe brings its own unique flair to the battlefield, offering distinct playstyles and aesthetics that will resonate with every gamer's preferences.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Challenge your friends in different Game Modes</strong> \u2014 Experience the thrill of strategic teamwork and precision aiming in Capture the Flag. Dominate the battlefield alongside your squad in Team Deathmatch and test your individual mettle in Free-For-All battles! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Defend your Tribe in all the different maps</strong> \u2014 Battle across a variety of maps, from the bustling parking lot to the lively festival map and the gritty docks in Shipyard, testing your mettle. Adapt, outsmart, and defend your tribe to victory! </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Dive into the future of gaming and wield your own arsenal of weapons against adversaries. Most importantly, revel in the chaos of possibilities that the weapons provide in this new type of game and have an absolute blast!",
